OL,3,ABadenoch pledges inheritance tax
OL,4,Achanges as she pitches Tories as
OL,5,A'no-nonsense' party
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative Party leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Fhas pledged to scrap inheritance tax
OL,9,F(IHT) on family homes and increase the
OL,10,Famount couples can leave tax-free to
OL,11,F#1m, in her keynote speech at the
OL,12,Fparty's conference in Birmingham.
OL,14,FBadenoch added her ambition would be
OL,15,Ffor a Conservative government to
OL,16,Fabolish IHT "as soon as we can afford
OL,17,Fit", but said she could not currently
OL,18,Fpropose this due to spending
OL,19,Fcommitments on defence, prisons and the
OL,20,Feconomy.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
