OL,3,AChrista Pike's lawyers in court after
OL,4,Afailed execution of US death row inmate
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyers for US death row inmate Christa
OL,7,FPike are in court today asking a judge
OL,8,Fto order Tennessee to preserve all
OL,9,Fevidence from her botched execution
OL,10,Flast week - watch live above
OL,12,FThe emergency motion filed by her legal
OL,13,Fteam could lay the groundwork for a
OL,14,Ffuture lawsuit against the state over
OL,15,Fhow the failed execution was carried
OL,16,Fout
OL,18,FKey moments are expected to come under
OL,19,Fthe microscope in court, our reporter
OL,20,Fwrites
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
