OL,3,A'What happened here was not human':
OL,4,AIsrael marks three years since 7
OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraelis are marking three years since
OL,8,Fthe Hamas-led attack on 7 October 2023,
OL,9,Fin which about 1,200 people were killed
OL,10,Fand 251 others were taken hostage
OL,12,FMemorial events are being held across
OL,13,FIsrael and the world, with a vigil
OL,14,Ftaking place in central London from
OL,15,F17:00 BST - watch live at the top of
OL,16,Fthe page
OL,18,FIn Israel commemorations began with a
OL,19,Fnationwide minute's silence at 06:29
OL,20,Flocal time (04:29 BST), to mark the
OL,21,Ftime the attacks started
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
