OL,3,AIsraelis demand accountability over 7
OL,4,AOctober failures three years after
OL,5,Aattacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the sky began to lighten over
OL,8,FIsrael's border with Gaza on Wednesday,
OL,9,Fthe people of Kfar Aza moved silently
OL,10,Ftowards the armoury at the centre of
OL,11,Fthe kibbutz.
OL,13,FIt was there, shortly after 07:00 on 7
OL,14,FOctober 2023, that Hamas-led attackers
OL,15,Fkilled half the community's 14-member
OL,16,Fcivil defence squad. They were among 64
OL,17,Fkilled and 19 kidnapped from the
OL,18,Fcommunity that day.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
